    "detailed_description": "Meet Dood, a 30-year-old slightly balding man trying to navigate the challenges of a physics-based life. Enter, stage left: Zooblies. A strange and plethoric (in both senses of the word) species of creatures whose sole purpose is to be in the way of our protagonist\u2019s goal: a (possibly metaphorical) path through a series of dark dungeons and out into the light. Learn the ways (rules) of the world (game) and help Dood achieve personal growth and realization!!!<br><br>K but it\u2019s a physics-based puzzle platformer where each type of Zooblie has its own behavior. When Dood moves, time moves. When Dood stops, time stops, and you as the player-god-emperor can drag and rotate <i>blue things</i> (but only <i>blue things</i>) into whatever mise-en-scene pleases your divine (?) sensibilities.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Help Dood reach the exit in over 50 levels!<br></li><li>Encounter all X types of Zooblies!<br></li><li>\u00a1Collect todas las estrellas for a challenge especial!<br></li><li>Watch as Dood busts some righteous dance moves!</li></ul><br>Help a Dood out, will ya?\ud83d\udc96",
